TUTORIAL:
1. Open our channel on Telegram Desktop (PC);
2. Click the ⋮ three vertical dots in the top right corner;
3. Select the "Export Chat History" option;
4. You can customize the settings depending on how much space you have, strive to export every type of media;
5. Hit the export button to save everything to your hard drive.
